{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Trace","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":26,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace_near_q0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace_near_q0","kind":"theorem","line":247,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L247-L253","doc":"Numerical envelope at the proton pin `q₀ = 1.1099785827513808…`: `1.187 < W(q₀) < 1.188`\n(the producer reports `1.18748…`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace_one","kind":"theorem","line":241,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L241-L245","doc":"`W(1) = 1/4`: at the classical point the `T(3,5)` trace collapses to the `SU(2)` weight\n`y₍₃₎(1) − y₍₂₁₎(1) = 1/2 − 1/4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace_numerator_eq_jones","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace_numerator_eq_jones","kind":"theorem","line":235,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L235-L239","doc":"**Jones cross-check.** `T(3,5) = 10₁₂₄` has `V(t) = t⁴ + t⁶ − t¹⁰`; the numerator of `W` is\n`q²² · V(q⁻²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace_eq_wedderburn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace_eq_wedderburn","kind":"theorem","line":229,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L229-L233","doc":"The Wedderburn form of the answer: `W(q) = y₍₃₎ q¹⁰ − y₍₂₁₎`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace_eq","kind":"theorem","line":221,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L221-L227","doc":"**Main result.** The convention-D Markov trace of the `T(3,5)` braid `(σ₀σ₁)⁵ ∈ H₃(q)` —\ntrivial-block value `q¹⁰`, `(2,1)`-block matrix `(σ₀σ₁)⁵` — is `q²(q¹² + q⁸ − 1)/(q² + 1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.weakVertexTrace","kind":"def","line":217,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L217-L219","doc":"The weak-vertex form factor `W(q) = q²(q¹² + q⁸ − 1)/(q² + 1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_sigma010","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_sigma010","kind":"theorem","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L206-L213","doc":"`tr_M(σ₀σ₁σ₀) = h z² + z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_sigma10","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_sigma10","kind":"theorem","line":197,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L197-L204","doc":"`tr_M(σ₁σ₀) = z²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_sigma01","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_sigma01","kind":"theorem","line":190,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L190-L195","doc":"`tr_M(σ₀σ₁) = z²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_sigma1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_sigma1","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L183-L188","doc":"`tr_M(σ₁) = z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_sigma0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_sigma0","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L176-L181","doc":"`tr_M(σ₀) = z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD_basis_one","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L169-L174","doc":"The weights sum to `1` with the sign block absent: `y₍₃₎ + 2 y₍₂₁₎ = 1`, i.e. `tr_M(1) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.ocneanuD","kind":"def","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L164-L167","doc":"The Wedderburn functional `y₍₃₎ · χ₍₃₎ + y₍₂₁₎ · χ₍₂₁₎` (the sign block has weight `0`),\napplied to an element given by its trivial-block value `a` and its `(2,1)`-block matrix `M`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.yStd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.yStd","kind":"def","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L161-L162","doc":"Wedderburn weight of the `(2,1)` block. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.yTriv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.yTriv","kind":"def","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L158-L159","doc":"Wedderburn weight of the trivial block `(3)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.hq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.hq","kind":"def","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L155-L156","doc":"Hecke parameter `h = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.zD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.zD","kind":"def","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L152-L153","doc":"Convention-D Markov parameter `z = q³/(q² + 1)` (owner ruling R1, 2026-08-15). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.chi21_T35","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.chi21_T35","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L142-L148","doc":"The `(2,1)` character of the `T(3,5)` braid: `χ₍₂₁₎((σ₀σ₁)⁵) = −1`, independent of `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen_M_pow_five","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen_M_pow_five","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L134-L140","doc":"`(σ₀σ₁)⁵ = (σ₀σ₁)²` on the `(2,1)` block. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen_M_cubed_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen_M_cubed_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L124-L132","doc":"**The full twist is trivial on `(2,1)`**: `(σ₀σ₁)³ = 1`, for every `q ≠ 0`.  This is the\n`q`-independent fact behind the whole computation — `(σ₀σ₁)³ = Δ²` acts on the `(2,1)` block by\n`q^{2·(content sum)}` and the content sum of `(2,1)` is `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen_M","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen_M","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L117-L122","doc":"`σ₀σ₁` on the `(2,1)` block is `⎡ 0  q ⎤ ⎣ −q⁻¹  −1 ⎦`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen_braid","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L109-L115","doc":"Braid relation `σ₀σ₁σ₀ = σ₁σ₀σ₁` on the `(2,1)` block. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen1_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen1_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L101-L107","doc":"Hecke quadratic relation for `σ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen0_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen0_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L93-L99","doc":"Hecke quadratic relation for `σ₀`: `σ₀² = (q − q⁻¹) σ₀ + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen1","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L89-L91","doc":"`σ₁` on the `(2,1)` block, Young seminormal form: `⎡ −q⁻¹  0 ⎤ ⎣ 1  q ⎦`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.stdGen0","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexT35TraceClosedForm.lean#L85-L87","doc":"`σ₀` on the `(2,1)` block, Young seminormal form: `⎡ q  1 ⎤ ⎣ 0  −q⁻¹ ⎦`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}